{# I0 - INSTRUCTIONAL (GOVERNED Authority)
 Identity and specialized manuals defining agent capabilities.
 Defines "How" the agent acts with GOVERNED authority.
#}
================================================================================
AGENT IDENTITY & CAPABILITIES (GOVERNED AUTHORITY)
================================================================================

{% if agent_identity %}
IDENTITY: {{ agent_identity }}
{% endif %}

{% if mixins %}
MIXINS LOADED:
{% for mixin in mixins %}
- {{ mixin }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if capabilities %}
CAPABILITIES:
{% for cap in capabilities %}
- {{ cap.name }}: {{ cap.description }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if operational_mode %}
OPERATIONAL MODE: {{ operational_mode }}
{% endif %}

{% if tool_access %}
TOOL ACCESS SCOPE: {{ tool_access }}
{% endif %}

================================================================================
OPERATE WITHIN DEFINED CAPABILITIES. ESCALATE IF REQUESTED ACTION EXCEEDS SCOPE.
================================================================================
